    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a dark, biomechanical, aquatic world filled with danger around every corner. Hungry creatures lie in wait to devour you, lurking within the shadowy depths - waiting for the perfect opportunity to strike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and swim through hazards. Try to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a biomechanical aquatic creature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to solve puzzles and outwit enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384150/extras/29e4c43d12f8eae6c35fd41bff6ee71e.poster.avif?t=1745548719\" width=552 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384150/extras/29e4c43d12f8eae6c35fd41bff6ee71e.webm?t=1745548719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your boost to speed past dangerous enemies and push objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384150/extras/1c7ed9c3d0048112392face6b76431a3.poster.avif?t=1745548719\" width=552 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384150/extras/1c7ed9c3d0048112392face6b76431a3.webm?t=1745548719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various mechanisms to help solve puzzles and open passageways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384150/extras/99e84695ded1c968bf9df8d65367fa63.poster.avif?t=1745548719\" width=552 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384150/extras/99e84695ded1c968bf9df8d65367fa63.webm?t=1745548719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
